source_raw_tex:
\eqalign{k_n&=\Bover{n}2\text{ for even }n,\cr
&=-\Bover{n+1}2\text{ for odd }n,\cr
q_n&=\Bover{n-m^3-m^2}{m+1}
  \text{ if }m\in\Bbb N\text{ and }m^3\le n<(m+1)^3.\cr}

